rvice sign-up is limited to people already on the employee roster (Master List). Admin and checker accounts are created by the Super Admin instead.&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="24" width="1163" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-start" value="START" style="shape=mxgraph.flowchart.terminator;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e3a8a;strokeColor=#1e3a8a;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="505" y="145" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-in" value="Open the Register page; enter full&lt;br&gt;name, email, password, confirm&lt;br&gt;password; accept the Terms" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;size=16;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="258" width="280" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-bot" value="Bot check passed?&lt;br&gt;(hidden field +&lt;br&gt;reCAPTCHA)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#b58b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="400" width="210" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-val" value="Inputs valid?&lt;br&gt;(strong password,&lt;br&gt;passwords match)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#b58b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="550" width="210" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-ros" value="Email is on the&lt;br&gt;employee roster /&lt;br&gt;Master List?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#b58b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="700" width="210" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-dup" value="Email already&lt;br&gt;has an account?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#b58b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="852" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-err" value='Show error message and&lt;br&gt;return to the registration form&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Failed bot check&lt;br&gt;• Weak or mismatched password&lt;br&gt;• "Could not create a new account&lt;br&gt;  with that email — use the email&lt;br&gt;  the HR office has on file"' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#b91c1c;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="933" y="402" width="250" height="550" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-rule" value="Password rules: at least 12 characters,&lt;br&gt;upper- and lower-case letters, a number,&lt;br&gt;a symbol, and not a commonly leaked&lt;br&gt;password." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="57" y="559" width="260" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-link" value="Link to (or create) the&lt;br&gt;employee record" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="1020" width="210" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-mk" value="Create the user account&lt;br&gt;role = employee, status = pending" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465" y="1146" width="250" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-db" value="Users and&lt;br&gt;Employees" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#475569;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="973" y="1140" width="170" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-redir" value='Go to Employee Login with&lt;br&gt;"Account created" message' style="shape=parallelogra